 "name_en": "Integrated Financial Planning (4RC)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Integrated Financial Planning (4RC)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio958a79d8766743698b8ae67260335364\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio958a79d8766743698b8ae67260335364__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This process supports detailed financial planning to set operational targets and to provide a baseline for the valuation of operational processes. It includes:</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">• Cost and activity planning to determine cost flows and activity rates</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">• Sales and profitability planning to determine volume and price targets, expected discounts, and cost of goods sold</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">• Product cost simulation to determine raw material prices and activity usage</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">• Project planning to provide a baseline for revenue recognition and for capital expense projects</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">• Financial statement planning, including profit and loss, balance sheet, and cash flow</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio958a79d8766743698b8ae67260335364__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Access reference data relevant for planning</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Capture planning assumptions from key stakeholders</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Aggregate plan as basis for financial statement</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio958a79d8766743698b8ae67260335364__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Calculate activity rates for production and service activities including all relevant cost inputs and activity flows</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Calculate product rates for manufactured products, leveraging detailed information from cost estimates</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Calculate sales profitability including detailed quantities, prices discounts, and cost of goods sold</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Calculate capital expenses</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>集成财务计划 (4RC)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio958a79d8766743698b8ae67260335364\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio958a79d8766743698b8ae67260335364__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此流程支持详细的财务计划，以设置运营目标并为运营流程的评估提供基线。其中包括：</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">• 确定成本流和活动率的成本和活动计划</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">• 销售和获利能力计划，用于确定数量和价格目标、预期折扣和销货成本</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">• 产品成本模拟以确定原材料价格和活动使用</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">• 制定项目计划，为收入确认和资本费用项目提供基线</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">• 财务报表计划，包括损益、资产负债表和现金流</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio958a79d8766743698b8ae67260335364__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">访问与计划相关的参考数据</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">捕获关键利益相关方的计划假设</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">汇总计划作为财务报表的基础</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio958a79d8766743698b8ae67260335364__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">计算生产和服务活动的活动率，包括所有相关成本输入和活动流</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">利用成本估算的详细信息，计算制造产品的产品率</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">计算销售获利能力，包括详细数量、价格折扣和销货成本</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">计算资本费用</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
